// inside a `layerStyle="page"` container (PDP's Complete-the-Set/Might-Also-Like/Recently-Viewed,
// PLP's Recently-Viewed) previously used plain Chakra numeric spacing (`{base: -4, md: -8, lg:
// 0}`, i.e. -16px/-32px/0) with no relationship at all to this site's own real page padding. That
