  test('empty state gate is hasRecentlyViewed, not cards.length: renders the grid, not the empty state, while the product fetch is still in flight for a shopper with real tracked ids', () => {
    // The exact race this container's own docblock documents: recentlyViewedIds is non-empty
    // (hasRecentlyViewed true) but the fetch hasn't resolved yet, so products (and therefore
    // cards) is still []. Gating on cards.length === 0 would incorrectly show the empty-state
    // copy here; gating on hasRecentlyViewed must not.
